        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9035/32, 1-1/4 Inch Helsinki Cabinet Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 1-1/4 Inch Diameter Helsinki Cabinet Knob goes great with any cabinet pull in the <a href=\"/collections/omnia-cabinet-hardware\">Omnia Ultima Collection</a>. It's modern style is accented with 6 beautiful finishes. This 1-1/4 Inch Helsinki Cabinet Door Knob has a 1-1/4 inch projection. It is great for use all over the house--not just on kitchen cabinets. Update your tired furniture by switching out old cabinet hardware for this new, contemporary style. It can also be used on the bathroom vanity. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in \r\n<a href=\"/products/1-inch-diameter-helsinki-cabinet-knob-omnia-9035-25\"><b>1 Inch Diameter Helsinki Cabinet Knob</b></a> and\r\n<a href=\"/products/1-1-2-inch-diameter-helsinki-cabinet-knob-omnia-9035-38\"><b>1-1/2 Inch Diameter Helsinki Cabinet Knob</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9035 Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
